The data this plugin reads are Fannie Mae's and Freddie Mac's mortgage
securities disclosures, which each agency publishes to its registered users
under its own terms. tests/responses/freddie-remic-factor-sample.txt is
Freddie Mac's published sample of its REMIC factor file layout (randomised
data). This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Fannie Mae or
Freddie Mac.
